<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-BLUE CHIPS STABLE TO HIGHER, OLAINFARM DOWN.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-BLUE CHIPS STABLE TO HIGHER, OLAINFARM DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Official list stocks were mixed at</p>
<p>the morning price fix on Monday and Unibanka added two santimes</p>
<p>to 3.38 lats. The Riga Shipyard shed two santimes to 1.30 lats.</p>
<p>On the secondary list, the Olainfarm pharmaceutical company</p>
<p>fell to 2.17 lats from 2.55 lats.</p>
